{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2021-07-19 10:51:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION RETURNS TO ISC WEST AS TRUSTED PARTNER, LEADER IN SEAMLESS ACCESS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, JULY 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALLEGION\xa0US, A\xa0LEADING PROVIDER OF SECURITY PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS,\xa0WILL BE DEMONSTRATING NEW SEAMLESS ACCESS PRODUCTS AND SERVICES AT ISC WEST 2021\xa0(BOOTH #16059),, THE SECURITY INDUSTRY\'S MOST COMPREHENSIVE AND CONVERGED TRADE SHOW OCCURRING FROM JULY 19 – 21, 2021. "WITH BUSINESSES RETURNING TO FULL-SCALE OPERATIONS FOLLOWING THE EASING OF PANDEMIC RESTRICTIONS, ALLEGION IS COMMITTED TO HELPING SECURITY INTEGRATORS AND PACS PARTNERS BETTER SERVE THEIR HIGHER EDUCATION, K-12, HEALTHCARE AND MULTIFAMILY CUSTOMERS IN INNOVATIVE WAYS THAT DELIVER A SEAMLESS ACCESS EXPERIENCE WHILE PROMOTING HEALTHY ENVIRONMENTS," SAID BRAD AIKIN, DIRECTOR OF FIELD MARKETING AND TRAINING AT ALLEGION.'}{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2021-07-19 10:51:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION RETURNS TO ISC WEST AS TRUSTED PARTNER, LEADER IN SEAMLESS ACCESS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, JULY 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALLEGION\xa0US, A\xa0LEADING PROVIDER OF SECURITY PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS,\xa0WILL BE DEMONSTRATING NEW SEAMLESS ACCESS PRODUCTS AND SERVICES AT ISC WEST 2021\xa0(BOOTH #16059),, THE SECURITY INDUSTRY\'S MOST COMPREHENSIVE AND CONVERGED TRADE SHOW OCCURRING FROM JULY 19 – 21, 2021. "WITH BUSINESSES RETURNING TO FULL-SCALE OPERATIONS FOLLOWING THE EASING OF PANDEMIC RESTRICTIONS, ALLEGION IS COMMITTED TO HELPING SECURITY INTEGRATORS AND PACS PARTNERS BETTER SERVE THEIR HIGHER EDUCATION, K-12, HEALTHCARE AND MULTIFAMILY CUSTOMERS IN INNOVATIVE WAYS THAT DELIVER A SEAMLESS ACCESS EXPERIENCE WHILE PROMOTING HEALTHY ENVIRONMENTS," SAID BRAD AIKIN, DIRECTOR OF FIELD MARKETING AND TRAINING AT ALLEGION.'}{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2021-07-19 10:51:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION RETURNS TO ISC WEST AS TRUSTED PARTNER, LEADER IN SEAMLESS ACCESS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, JULY 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALLEGION\xa0US, A\xa